  "title": "Grilled Steelhead Trout",
  "description": "This simple preparation of steelhead trout calls for a sauteed, lemon-kissed mixture of garlic and onion to be brushed atop the fish as it grills on a bed of lemon slices.",
  "authors": [
    "TanFloridian"
  ],
